    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "If you requested photo capture in a RAW format, or in a processed format without compression such as TIFF, you can use this property to access the underlying sample buffer.",
      "ko": "A capture device’s [`focusPointOfInterest`](avcapturedevice/focuspointofinterest.md) and [`exposurePointOfInterest`](avcapturedevice/exposurepointofinterest.md) properties provide a [`CGPoint`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreFoundation/CGPoint) value where `{0,0}` represents the top-left and `{1,1}` represents the bottom-right of the unrotated image.",
      "sourceHash": "b6dfbcd3884019c132a94aefd43a521d4e3a7c766a9fdb66a1befe1f0ecec447",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "If you requested capture in a compressed format such as JPEG or HEVC/HEIF, this property’s value is `nil`.",
      "ko": "The system takes the layer’s frame size and its [`videoGravity`](avcapturevideopreviewlayer/videogravity.md) into consideration when making the conversion.",
      "sourceHash": "4eaf7dd5e3fe367740e4f1f4dd0efe45814bf4fea19e08706f9a205047ddb11a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0002",
      "source": "Use the [`fileDataRepresentation()`](avcapturephoto/filedatarepresentation().md) or [`cgImageRepresentation()`](avcapturephoto/cgimagerepresentation().md) method to obtain compressed image data.",
      "ko": "압축된 이미지 데이터를 얻으려면 [`fileDataRepresentation()`](avcapturephoto/filedatarepresentation().md) 또는 [`cgImageRepresentation()`](avcapturephoto/cgimagerepresentation().md) 메서드를 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7d6854edbf4ae2db79b4abd688cabbed3b9a2de2a68a8a8c171f71870c1c9e4b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
